# Parameter file for US-Blo MCMC calibration with reduced parameter space
# Only photosynthesis parameters (slatop, leafcn, flnr) vary during MCMC
# Root parameters are effectively fixed at their best values from previous MCMC
#
# This approach allows reusing the existing 20-parameter surrogate model
# without retraining, while only calibrating the 3 most sensitive parameters
#
# Format: parameter_name  pft  min  max
#
# Based on:
# - Wang, B., McCormack, M.L., Ricciuto, D.M., Yang, X., and Iversen, C.M. (2023)
#   "Embracing fine-root system complexity in terrestrial ecosystem modelling"
#   Global Change Biology. https://doi.org/10.1111/gcb.16659

# ============================================================================
# PHOTOSYNTHESIS PARAMETERS (CALIBRATED - FULL RANGES)
# ============================================================================

# Specific Leaf Area at top of canopy (m²/gC)
# High sensitivity (21.1% of total variance)
slatop 1 0.018 0.028

# Leaf C:N ratio (gC/gN)
# High sensitivity (31.0% of total variance)
leafcn 1 25 40

# Fraction of leaf N in Rubisco (unitless)
# Highest sensitivity (47.6% of total variance)
flnr 1 0.10 0.18

